WEBVTT

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.900
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.670
This is our opponent for the semi-finals, Arakumo Academy.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.250
According to our information, they're players who are perfect in every aspect.

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.580
They've been assessed to be a team that is superior in both tactics and individual strength.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.850
Aren't they another school under Fifth Sector's control anyway?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.500
Unfortunately, yes.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.440
Shouldn't we be assuming that by now?

00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:47.540
We just gotta keep going down our path.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:50.050
W-What?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.180
Kurama-senpai, you're so right!

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.180
We just gotta keep going down our path.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:56.550
I think that's so cool of you!

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:01.260
Then starting today, we'll adjust the training menu for the game against Arakumo Academy...

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:03.320
There's trouble!

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:04.460
Fifth Sector, they...

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:06.960
What happened?

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.210
Fifth Sector has resorted to using force on other schools.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.760
Using force?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:58.300
You've probably heard about schools that have been motivated by Raimon to oppose Fifth Sector.

00:02:58.930 --> 00:03:02.450
Tengawara and Mannouzaka were some of them, right?

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:06.250
Yeah, there are other schools around the nation that are joining in too.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:08.790
Around the nation, that's pretty big.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:13.030
But Fifth Sector has started going to those schools to destroy them.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.210
Destroy them?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:17.710
To be exact, they abolished the schools.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:19.940
Including Tengawara?

00:03:20.310 --> 00:03:24.590
No, but three schools in other regions were taken down.

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:27.040
Schools that lost in the prelims.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.770
They're trying to make examples out of them.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.520
That's terrible of them!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:37.520
Thing is, some of the students from those abolished schools are blaming it on Raimon.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:43.240
It'd only be natural for them to hold a grudge after their school was taken away from them.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:44.990
But that's...

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.080
I wouldn't put it past them if it's Fifth Sector.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.140
That's outrageous! We can't let them do that!

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:53.430
Yeah, it's no laughing matter!

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:58.880
At this rate, guys who joined us like Gassan Kunimitsu and Hakuren will be in danger too!

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.720
If they keep getting abolished or destroyed,

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:06.130
all of the momentum we've been gaining might just go in the other direction.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.730
Backfire, huh...

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:14.000
But people might see it as Fifth Sector starting to panic if they have to resort to abolishing schools.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:18.210
The Fifth is starting to feel the brunt of our revolution!

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:20.760
That's why they have to go as far as to abolish schools.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.240
In the end, they're just running themselves into the ground!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.370
Well said, Amagi!

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.220
This isn't just a problem for our soccer club anymore.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.700
This is a fight for all of jr. high school soccer around the nation!

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.640
Yeah!

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:35.650
War, war! We'll do it!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.570
It's turning into something really huge.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.620
You hear what our seniors are saying?

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.100
Let's do it, Tenma!

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.450
Fifth Sector is afraid of us!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:47.160
That just shows how strong we've gotten, right?

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:51.230
Besides, this is all from the wind you started, Tenma.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:52.690
It's not like you'd stop now.

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.690
But I...

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.570
What's wrong?

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:02.660
The wind you started is finally putting Fifth Sector on the move.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.490
Isn't that amazing?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:07.320
Yeah, but...

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:11.300
Everyone, let's win against Arakumo Academy and move onto the finals.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:17.880
Tenma, the other schools must also be wanting to play soccer freely like us.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.380
Let's face Fifth Sector even more boldly with those feelings.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:24.090
We'll stir up an even bigger wind!

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:34.890
Um...

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:41.400
If we keep up this battle, won't more schools end up getting closed down because of us?

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:49.530
I'm sure a lot of jr. high school students right now are in a lot of trouble because they don't have a school.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:54.910
When I start thinking about those people, I get kind of scared...

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.030
So... I'm sorry!

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:04.670
Tenma!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:05.260
Tenma!

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.220
Wait!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:06.980
Leave him alone.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.130
But...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.940
That's the best thing to do for now.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.900
Tenma-kun!

00:06:18.470 --> 00:06:21.410
What's wrong? It's almost time for practice.

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.130
Tenma-kun?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:29.860
They've finally started abolishing schools...

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:35.120
Chairman Kinzan, why have they spared our school from that punishment?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.620
Have you heard anything?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.640
No, I haven't received any notifications.

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:48.010
Even since the Nationals started, we've been getting an increase of transfer student requests by the day.

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.930
And phone calls of protest as well...

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.220
It's such an irony.

00:06:54.220 --> 00:07:01.320
By opposing Fifth Sector, our school has ended up getting a lot of attention.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:06.150
What does Fifth Sector intend to do with our school?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:12.660
I have a feeling that we've been left of the loop somehow, Principal Fuyukai.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.980
Yes...

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:21.210
I've been playing just because I love soccer.

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.420
But so many schools are getting destroyed now.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:32.370
They've taken a bold move to start abolishing schools.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:35.860
Even so, Tenma-kun shouldn't feel responsible for that.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.350
At this rate, Raimon will get destroyed...

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:45.240
Right now, Raimon is the symbol of free soccer in the youth soccer world.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:47.330
Everyone has their attention on it.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:53.240
That's why they're trying to take down that symbol in a big spectacle like Holy Road.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:58.930
By taking down Raimon, Fifth Sector would be able to assert their ideals as correct.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.880
Then that's even less reason for us to give up.

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:18.810
I can't play soccer feeling like this.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:26.640
Coach Endou, what should I do?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:28.030
Hey, you.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:32.570
Me?

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.580
You're Matsukaze Tenma-kun, right?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.390
I am.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.950
Um, who are you?

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.480
I'm Yuuka.

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:45.540
There's someone I'd like you to meet right now.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.870
Meet someone?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.090
It's very important.

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.120
Just wait a moment.

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:51.980
Okay...

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:25.600
You're...

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.870
Ishido Shuuji.

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.260
I see you've been doing a lot on the field, Matsukaze Tenma-kun.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.080
Why are you here to see me?

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.900
You changed Raimon Jr. High.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:43.850
And now you're trying to change the youth soccer world through Holy Road.

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.940
Change it?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:50.280
I just wanted to play the soccer I love, the way I like it.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:53.770
Aren't you the one who made soccer the way it is now?

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.060
Why?

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.660
Soccer should be more enjoyable.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.500
You don't have to manage the game scores, soccer is-

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.500
Do you believe that with all your heart?

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.110
Why do you ask that?

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:13.520
What do you think about Fifth Sector abolishing schools that oppose them?

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.440
I can't forgive that.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:17.710
Right, it's unforgivable.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:21.850
But the one who drove that to occur was none other than you.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:29.770
Your feelings for soccer are stealing soccer away from the youths who want to enjoy it.

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:37.890
And you've now realized that, in reality, soccer should be managed for everyone to enjoy.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:42.720
No.

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:43.820
Soccer is...

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:48.710
She's getting mugged!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.040
No, let go!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:53.980
Stop!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.400
What's with you? Move!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.250
Let go!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.300
Why, you!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.490
No way...

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:26.400
Oh, crap!

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.540
Hey, wait right there!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:31.680
Hey, wait!

00:11:31.680 --> 00:11:32.800
Thank you.

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:33.640
Are you okay?

00:11:34.220 --> 00:11:35.000
Yes.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.670
Thank you.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:42.170
Are you...?

00:11:57.560 --> 00:11:58.610
It was you.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:05.650
You were the one who saved me from the falling boards at the beach...

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:12.590
That's what got me to start playing soccer!

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:17.380
I've been dreaming to play soccer at Raimon ever since I saw the ball you left behind!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:19.480
Why are you doing this to soccer?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.530
Don't you love soccer more than anyone else?

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:23.830
I can tell!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:28.370
That is exactly why I decided to manage soccer.

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:31.860
I'm controlling soccer in order to protect it.

00:12:31.860 --> 00:12:35.310
How is controlling it protecting it?

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.830
That ball back then and the one just now...

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:41.760
Someone who doesn't love soccer wouldn't be able to shoot like that!

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.550
But why...?

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:48.580
If you want to know the answer, win through Holy Road.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.610
What do you mean?

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:04.420
So you and Tenma-kun had a past encounter.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.990
The one he admires is his enemy...

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.430
Will he be able to keep fighting?

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.370
He will, Yuuka.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.970
No, he's the only one who <i>can.</i>

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:18.360
You think pretty highly of him.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.620
It's only that I believe in Matsukaze Tenma's feelings towards soccer.

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.130
That part of you hasn't changed.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.270
But what about them?

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:31.770
It wasn't you who ordered for the rebelling schools to be destroyed, right?

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.430
It was that other man's.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.130
It doesn't matter who ordered it.

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:41.290
Soccer as it is right now has taken over the lives of too many people.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.960
Tsurugi...

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.670
I understand what Matsukaze's worried about.

00:13:52.670 --> 00:13:54.180
That's why I have to ask.

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.370
Your shoot that knocked over that mugger...

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.060
I got a shock from it in a different way from Matsukaze.

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:05.150
I've seen that shoot style in the past.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.240
My brother and I have always looked up to it.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:11.050
You're Gouenji Shuuya, are you not?

00:14:12.090 --> 00:14:15.750
If you're really Gouenji-san, then Coach Endou is your best friend, right?

00:14:16.480 --> 00:14:20.340
I finally understand what your true motive is.

00:14:20.340 --> 00:14:21.360
I see.

00:14:22.100 --> 00:14:23.380
Then what of it?

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.860
Why won't you tell Matsukaze?

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.320
The time hasn't come yet.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.890
If I do, everything I've done up until now will be for naught.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.560
True, it might be better to keep things as they are.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.920
Then I have a request.

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:51.950
Captain...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.080
He's back.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.740
Tenma.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:56.560
We were worried.

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.480
Why?

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:02.630
I thought Aki-san would have an idea of where you went.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:05.220
He even went to the riverbank.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:11.940
I thought you'd be somewhere playing with the ball by yourself to calm your feelings down.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.690
Hey there, Sasuke.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:26.830
Come to think of it, this is my first time in your room.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:28.320
Yes.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:32.790
What's this?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.660
Isn't this Raimon's mark?

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:40.160
That ball... is Ishido Shuuji's.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:41.620
What?

00:15:42.490 --> 00:15:45.070
I just came back from meeting Ishido Shuuji.

00:15:50.910 --> 00:15:53.090
Have some tea and snacks.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:57.290
Um, what did you want to talk to me about?

00:15:57.290 --> 00:15:59.220
There's something I've had on my mind for a while.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:03.060
Shinsuke, would you like to work on being a goalkeeper from now on?

00:16:04.660 --> 00:16:07.400
My mind was set after the match with Gen'ei.

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:10.610
Your jump power would be a great asset to being a goalkeeper.

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:14.110
But that happened so suddenly...

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.910
<i>I'll protect Raimon's goal!</i>

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:20.240
Yeah!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.630
I just went with the moment that one time.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:27.210
But I was only able to block them because of help from you guys.

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:33.230
I've only played as a field player this whole time, so I've never thought about being a goalkeeper.

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:37.530
And I'm not very tall...

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:39.390
I'm okay being a field player.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.910
That's a pretty passive opinion.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.820
You can't just say, "I'm okay with it",

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:47.740
you have to say, "This is what I <i>want</i> ", if you want to convince your seniors.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.320
You're so strict, Aoi-chan...

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:54.170
Well, you should give it some more thought.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:54.870
Okay.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:55.880
See you!

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:57.460
Senpai, good work today!

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:58.700
Good work.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.370
That was a surprise.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:07.010
I was really moved when everyone helped me protect the goal during the Gen'ei match, but...

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:09.150
Yeah, that was really great.

00:17:09.150 --> 00:17:14.320
Amagi-senpai and the others did a good job bringing out your power.

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.370
Can I really do it?

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:27.480
I see, you had a pretty eventful day.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.030
Yes.

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:33.730
Holy Emperor Ishido Shuuji is your life's savior and the one who started you on soccer...

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:38.490
In other words, he's the start of the wind that's blowing now through Holy Road.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.540
Am I right?

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:44.430
If Ishido Shuuji hadn't saved you back then, you wouldn't be where you are now.

00:17:47.890 --> 00:17:49.440
The situation's been reversed.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:53.500
It's the opposite of when you came into my room.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.720
That's true.

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:59.980
But why did the Holy Emperor come to meet you?

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:03.520
That I don't know.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:07.060
If you want to know the answer, you'll have to win through Holy Road.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.980
To me, that sounds like he was trying to encourage you.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:12.860
Really?

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:15.530
But he said the school abolishments are my fault...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:19.110
That also sounds like he said it to spur you on.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.660
The Holy Emperor's full of mysteries.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:28.580
Tenma, the Raimon today is different from the Raimon when you first entered.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:33.460
Everyone's pumped with motivation to win the championship.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:39.300
Even today, they practiced with everything they had for the upcoming match against Arakumo Academy.

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:47.670
The wind you stirred up motivated us, and now it's spread nationwide.

00:18:47.670 --> 00:18:49.510
You understand that, right?

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:50.850
Yes.

00:18:51.300 --> 00:18:57.020
You taught me that the most important thing was my love for soccer.

00:18:57.980 --> 00:19:01.160
You haven't kicked the ball today yet, right?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.240
Will you come to the riverbank with me?

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.520
I want to play soccer with you.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:12.310
Forget the revolution and all that.
I just want to kick the ball around with you.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.050
I see...

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:19.720
When you feel up for it, come over.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:30.770
I'll be going now. Thank you for the snacks.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:33.940
How's Tenma?

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:37.070
I think he'll be all right.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.260
{>w< ~}

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:15.000
Stop that, Sasuke.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.510
Captain!

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.100
I knew you'd come.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:54.810
I want to play soccer with everyone at Raimon!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:59.370
I won't hesitate anymore. I want to enjoy it with everything I've got!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.440
Because I love soccer!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:02.990
All right.

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.100
Let's win the semi-finals!

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:12.870
Yeah.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:16.820
Let's win the Holy Road championship and see what the Holy Emperor's answer is.

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:17.920
Yes!

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:25.830
We'll show that man that this is how you enjoy soccer!

